  triage:title "workspace compile error E0433 — TemplateOutputFormat resolved at wrong module path" ;
  triage:description "rust-qa-agent reported, independently confirmed by quality-mgr: workspace compile error E0433 at crates/atm-daemon-bootstrap/src/lib.rs:462,476 — code references atm_core::TemplateOutputFormat which doesn't exist at that path; the correct path is atm_core::boundary::TemplateOutputFormat. This is the ROOT CAUSE of PR #876's live CI failures (confirmed via `gh pr checks 876`: Clippy fail, Just lint fail on all 3 OSes, Test jobs skipped). Blocking, one-line import-path fix at 2 call sites." ;
